msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Yasuko「R-Ryuu-chan......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「R-Ryuu-chan......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué sucede?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan's heart is pounding～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「El corazón de Yacchan late con fuerza～」"

msgid "Yasuko「You two look so much alike. Hard not＿to remember～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Se parecen tanto los dos.＿Difícil no recordar～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"You two\"? Who do I look like?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Los dos\"? ¿A quién me parezco?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Well...... Oh, gotta go. It's time to＿prepare for business hours!」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Bueno...... Ah, tengo que irme. ¡Es＿hora de prepararse para abrir!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait, we aren't done talking yet......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espera, no terminamos de hablar......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh well. She's busy making＿preparations. I shouldn't stay here, so I＿guess I'll go home.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Bueno. Está ocupada haciendo los＿preparativos. No debería quedarme aquí,＿así que supongo que me iré a casa.」"
